                <pb facs="0510" n="440" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg440"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">713.1311/264a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lane</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-03-01T14:00:00-05:00">March 1, 1934—2 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Please inquire informally of President Sacasa whether he has selected
                    delegates to the Central American Conference and what preparations for it are
                    being made in Nicaragua.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
